{"id":"f98221b142491d15","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/492_直觉主义描述逻辑_iALC.md","title":"直觉主义描述逻辑 iALC","display":"直觉主义描述逻辑 iALC","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h2>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CN}\">\\(\\mathsf{CN}\\)</span> 为概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RN}\">\\(\\mathsf{RN}\\)</span> 为角色名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IN}\">\\(\\mathsf{IN}\\)</span> 为个体名集合，三者两两不交。概念构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acon},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad \\operatorname{top},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{exists},\\quad \\operatorname{forall}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{acon},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad \\operatorname{top},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{exists},\\quad \\operatorname{forall}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.-概念闭包\">2. 概念闭包</h2>\n<p>概念集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{CN}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{CN}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acon}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{acon}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>。在概念位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acon}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{acon}(A)\\)</span> 的显示别名；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CN}\">\\(\\mathsf{CN}\\)</span> 及概念名赋值函数的输入位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仍指概念名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D,C\\Rightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D,C\\Rightarrow D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C,\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\exists R.C,\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"3.-断言句法\">3. 断言句法</h2>\n<p>断言集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合。断言构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(a),\\qquad R(a,b),\\qquad C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(a),\\qquad R(a,b),\\qquad C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>。具体闭包条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\land a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\n\\Rightarrow\nC(a)\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\land a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\n\\Rightarrow\nC(a)\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\land a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\n\\Rightarrow\nR(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\land a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\n\\Rightarrow\nR(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\Rightarrow\nC\\sqsubseteq D\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\Rightarrow\nC\\sqsubseteq D\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限 TBox、ABox 与知识库载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\n\\bigl(\n\\{C(a):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{R(a,b):R\\in\\mathsf{RN},a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\}\n\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}\n\\bigl(\n\\{C(a):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{R(a,b):R\\in\\mathsf{RN},a,b\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\}\n\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"4.-名称出现与绑定\">4. 名称出现与绑定</h2>\n<p>定义概念名出现函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}:\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CN})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}:\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CN})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}(A)=\\{A\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}(A)=\\{A\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\Rightarrow D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}(C\\Rightarrow D)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{CNFV}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\exists R.C)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\forall R.C)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\exists R.C)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(\\forall R.C)=\\operatorname{CNFV}(C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CN}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(C)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CN}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(C)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.-概念替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">5. 概念替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价</h2>\n<p>概念名替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{CN}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{CN}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A[B:=E]=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;A=B,\\\\\nA,&amp;A\\ne B,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A[B:=E]=\n\\begin{cases}\nE,&amp;A=B,\\\\\nA,&amp;A\\ne B,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[B:=E]=\\bot,\\quad \\top[B:=E]=\\top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[B:=E]=\\bot,\\quad \\top[B:=E]=\\top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqcap D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\sqcap D[B:=E],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqcap D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\sqcap D[B:=E],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqcup D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\sqcup D[B:=E],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqcup D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\sqcup D[B:=E],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\Rightarrow D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\Rightarrow D[B:=E],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\Rightarrow D)[B:=E]=C[B:=E]\\Rightarrow D[B:=E],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists R.C)[B:=E]=\\exists R.(C[B:=E]),\n\\qquad\n(\\forall R.C)[B:=E]=\\forall R.(C[B:=E]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists R.C)[B:=E]=\\exists R.(C[B:=E]),\n\\qquad\n(\\forall R.C)[B:=E]=\\forall R.(C[B:=E]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言无绑定概念变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为语法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\qquad\nC\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}}D\\Longleftrightarrow C=D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\qquad\nC\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}}D\\Longleftrightarrow C=D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念替换扩张到断言的函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{CN}\\times\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\times\\mathsf{CN}\\times\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(a)[B:=E]=C[B:=E](a),\n\\qquad\nR(a,b)[B:=E]=R(a,b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(a)[B:=E]=C[B:=E](a),\n\\qquad\nR(a,b)[B:=E]=R(a,b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqsubseteq D)[B:=E]\n=\nC[B:=E]\\sqsubseteq D[B:=E].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqsubseteq D)[B:=E]\n=\nC[B:=E]\\sqsubseteq D[B:=E].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.-直觉主义解释\">6. 直觉主义解释</h2>\n<p>一个 iALC 解释为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\\preceq^\\mathcal I,\\{R^\\mathcal I:R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\},(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I=(\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\\preceq^\\mathcal I,\\{R^\\mathcal I:R\\in\\mathsf{RN}\\},(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^\\mathcal I\">\\(\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\)</span> 非空，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq^\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\times\\Delta^\\mathcal I\">\\(\\preceq^\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\times\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\)</span> 满足预序条件：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq^\\mathcal I x,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\preceq^\\mathcal I x,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\land y\\preceq^\\mathcal I z\n\\Rightarrow\nx\\preceq^\\mathcal I z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\land y\\preceq^\\mathcal I z\n\\Rightarrow\nx\\preceq^\\mathcal I z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"2\">\n<li>解释函数在名称上的类型为：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf C}:\\mathsf{CN}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^\\mathcal I),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf C}:\\mathsf{CN}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^\\mathcal I),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf I}:\\mathsf{IN}\\to\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf I}:\\mathsf{IN}\\to\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\times\\Delta^\\mathcal I\n\\quad(R\\in\\mathsf{RN}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\times\\Delta^\\mathcal I\n\\quad(R\\in\\mathsf{RN}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"3\">\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^\\mathcal I\">\\(R^\\mathcal I\\)</span> 单调：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\preceq x&#39;\\land xR^\\mathcal Iy\\land y\\preceq y&#39;\n\\Longrightarrow\nx&#39;R^\\mathcal Iy&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\preceq x&#39;\\land xR^\\mathcal Iy\\land y\\preceq y&#39;\n\\Longrightarrow\nx&#39;R^\\mathcal Iy&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"4\">\n<li>每个概念名解释上闭：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in A^\\mathcal I\\land x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\n\\Rightarrow\ny\\in A^\\mathcal I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in A^\\mathcal I\\land x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\n\\Rightarrow\ny\\in A^\\mathcal I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"5\">\n<li>每个个体名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{IN}\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^\\mathcal I\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\">\\(a^\\mathcal I\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的解释的类。概念解释函数记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\in\n\\prod_{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}}\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^\\mathcal I)\n\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n\\in\n\\prod_{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}}\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^\\mathcal I)\n\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ C⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal I)\">\\(⟦ C⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal I)\\)</span> 也写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\mathcal I\">\\(C^\\mathcal I\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义评估上下文集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EvalCtx}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal I,x):\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\land x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EvalCtx}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal I,x):\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\land x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念解释的递归子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acon}(A)^\\mathcal I=(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf C}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\bot^\\mathcal I=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\top^\\mathcal I=\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{acon}(A)^\\mathcal I=(\\cdot)^\\mathcal I_{\\mathsf C}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\bot^\\mathcal I=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\top^\\mathcal I=\\Delta^\\mathcal I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqcap D)^\\mathcal I=C^\\mathcal I\\cap D^\\mathcal I,\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcup D)^\\mathcal I=C^\\mathcal I\\cup D^\\mathcal I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqcap D)^\\mathcal I=C^\\mathcal I\\cap D^\\mathcal I,\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcup D)^\\mathcal I=C^\\mathcal I\\cup D^\\mathcal I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\Rightarrow D)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\forall y\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\Rightarrow(y\\in C^\\mathcal I\\Rightarrow y\\in D^\\mathcal I))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\Rightarrow D)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\forall y\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\Rightarrow(y\\in C^\\mathcal I\\Rightarrow y\\in D^\\mathcal I))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists R.C)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\exists y\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(xR^\\mathcal Iy\\land y\\in C^\\mathcal I)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists R.C)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\exists y\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(xR^\\mathcal Iy\\land y\\in C^\\mathcal I)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall R.C)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\forall y,z\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\land yR^\\mathcal Iz\\Rightarrow z\\in C^\\mathcal I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall R.C)^\\mathcal I\n=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I:\\forall y,z\\in\\Delta^\\mathcal I\\,(x\\preceq^\\mathcal I y\\land yR^\\mathcal Iz\\Rightarrow z\\in C^\\mathcal I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.-满足与后承\">7. 满足与后承</h2>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models C(a)\\Longleftrightarrow a^\\mathcal I\\in C^\\mathcal I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models C(a)\\Longleftrightarrow a^\\mathcal I\\in C^\\mathcal I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models R(a,b)\\Longleftrightarrow a^\\mathcal IR^\\mathcal Ib^\\mathcal I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models R(a,b)\\Longleftrightarrow a^\\mathcal IR^\\mathcal Ib^\\mathcal I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models C\\sqsubseteq D\\Longleftrightarrow C^\\mathcal I\\subseteq D^\\mathcal I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models C\\sqsubseteq D\\Longleftrightarrow C^\\mathcal I\\subseteq D^\\mathcal I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 中所有语句的 iALC 解释也满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义有效语句集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ValSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\\varnothing\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ValSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\\varnothing\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义语句满足证书与知识库反例证书</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SatCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal I,\\varphi):\n\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathcal I\\models\\varphi\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SatCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal I,\\varphi):\n\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathcal I\\models\\varphi\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)\n=\n\\{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathcal K\\ (\\mathcal I\\models\\psi),\n\\ \\neg(\\mathcal I\\models\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)\n=\n\\{\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}:\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathcal K\\ (\\mathcal I\\models\\psi),\n\\ \\neg(\\mathcal I\\models\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>真实主后承关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal K,\\varphi):\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal K,\\varphi):\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标特征是概念蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\Rightarrow D\">\\(C\\Rightarrow D\\)</span> 与角色限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span> 都通过预序持久性解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{iALC}\n=\n(\\mathsf{CN},\n\\mathsf{RN},\n\\mathsf{IN},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{CNFV},\n\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{SubSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{EvalCtx}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n⟦-⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{SatCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{ValSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{iALC}\n=\n(\\mathsf{CN},\n\\mathsf{RN},\n\\mathsf{IN},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Sent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{TBox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{ABox}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{CNFV},\n\\operatorname{CNBV}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\operatorname{SubSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{Int}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{EvalCtx}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n⟦-⟧_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{SatCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{CounterCert}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\mathsf{ValSent}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}},\n\\models_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 iALC 的概念句法、断言句法、直觉主义解释和语义后承；不含经典 ALC 语义、表演算或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":2},{"id":"2.-概念闭包","text":"2. 概念闭包","level":2},{"id":"3.-断言句法","text":"3. 断言句法","level":2},{"id":"4.-名称出现与绑定","text":"4. 名称出现与绑定","level":2},{"id":"5.-概念替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"5. 概念替换与 $\\alpha$ 等价","level":2},{"id":"6.-直觉主义解释","text":"6. 直觉主义解释","level":2},{"id":"7.-满足与后承","text":"7. 满足与后承","level":2},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{acon},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad \\operatorname{top},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{exists},\\quad \\operatorname{forall}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{CN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{acon}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{acon}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CN}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\top\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}","display":false},{"tex":"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{i\\mathcal{ALC}}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\sqcap D,C\\